#var, use command >Rest Client: Switch Environment in search bar of vs code
@id =1

###

### Get all faculties
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/faculties HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get faculties by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/faculties/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create a new faculties
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/faculties HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FCTEC",
  "name": "Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Naturales",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "description": "Facultad dedicada a las ciencias exactas y naturales"
}

###

### Update an existing faculties
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/faculties/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FCTEC",
  "description": "Facultad dedicada a las ciencias exactas y naturales - Actualizada",
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "name": "Facultad de Ciencias Exactas y Naturales"
}

###

### Delete a faculties
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/faculties/{{id}} HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
